# develop-full.rows — the full develop gate, as one committed rows file.
#
# Format: `name|expect|cmd`, one per line; expect is `0` or `nonzero`; cmd runs from the
# worktree root under bash (scripts/orch/gate.sh:9-12). `#` lines and blanks are skipped
# (scripts/orch/gate.sh:10).
#
# `|` is the field separator, but only the FIRST TWO are: `read -r name expect cmd` puts
# every remaining separator back into `cmd` verbatim, so a `|` in the command half is safe.
# The three `cargo tree` greps below still write an intermediate file and grep that, because
# a pipe inside a single-quoted `bash -c` is a row that reads worse than it runs.
#
# Every command goes through `scripts/orch/gr` (the ge-rust image), `scripts/orch/node-slim.sh`
# (node:22-slim) or `scripts/orch/drun --rm --pull never … ge-python-oracle` (the Python oracle arm).
# Never a bare cargo/rustc/npm/node.
#
# The knobs list exists once (the `negctl-*` group below). The 1000-seed and 10^5/10^6 rows
# are the slow ones and sit last, under `# slow:`.
#
# Run: scripts/orch/timed scripts/orch/gate.sh <logdir> scripts/orch/rows/develop-full.rows
# (`timed` takes the host-wide lock; parallel branches otherwise starve the run).

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# from scripts/orch/rows/quick.rows:1 — the quick gate, unchanged, first because a fresh
# worktree needs node_modules (npm-ci) and a built graph-core before anything below.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
fmt|0|scripts/orch/gr cargo fmt --all --check
clippy|0|scripts/orch/gr cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets -- -D warnings
test|0|scripts/orch/gr cargo test --workspace --no-fail-fast
wasm32-core|0|scripts/orch/gr cargo build -p graph-core --target wasm32-unknown-unknown
hashgate-8|0|scripts/orch/gr cargo run -q -p graph-cli -- hashgate --seeds 8
negctl-degree|0|scripts/orch/gr -e GM_MUTATE_REFERENCE_DEGREE=9 cargo run -q -p graph-cli -- hashgate --seeds 8; test $? -eq 1
npm-ci|0|scripts/orch/node-slim.sh npm ci --ignore-scripts
negctl-dim-z-mismatch|0|scripts/orch/gr -e GM_MUTATE_NODE_Z=1 cargo run -q -p graph-cli -- roundtrip --seeds 8; test $? -ne 0
force-gate-4|0|scripts/orch/gr cargo run -q -p graph-cli -- force-gate --seeds 4
negctl-force-gravity|0|scripts/orch/gr -e GM_MUTATE_FORCE_SESSION_GRAVITY=0.5 cargo run -q -p graph-cli -- force-gate --seeds 4; test $? -eq 1
negctl-drop-delta|0|scripts/orch/gr -e GM_MUTATE_DROP_DELTA=1 cargo run -q -p graph-cli -- force-gate --seeds 4; test $? -eq 1

